 partners\; collectives up to EUR 4\,500 combined\, max three stipends)\, w
 ith rent including service costs deducted from the stipend. Plus a EUR 2\,
 000 annual working budget and a newly built\, furnished private studio apa
 rtment. Application fee EUR 65 excl. VAT (EUR 78.65 incl. VAT)\, waived fo
