  deadline (researcher plus one partner organization)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 15 Dec 2026 at 20:00 EST.\n\nPartnership Engage Grants f
 und short-term\, partnered research between a postsecondary researcher and
  a single non-academic partner organization (public\, private or not-for-p
 rofit\, Canadian or international\, at arm's length)\, addressing a need i
 dentified by the partner.\n\nOrganisation: Social Sciences and Humanities 
 Research Council of Canada (SSHRC)\nLocation: Canada. Applicants must be a
 ffiliated with an eligible Canadian postsecondary institution\; the partne
 r can be Canadian or international.\nAward: CAD 10\,000 to 50\,000 over 1 
 year. No application fee.\nDuration: 1 year\n\nMore: https://sshrc-crsh.ca
 nada.ca/en/funding/opportunities/partnership-engage-grants/2026/competitio
