SUMMARY:Deadline 20:00 EST: SSHRC Connection Grants\, February 2027 deadlin
 e (events\, exhibitions\, festivals\, outreach)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 01 Feb 2027 at 20:00 EST.\n\nConnection Grants fund know
 ledge mobilization: events such as workshops\, symposia and conferences\, 
 and outreach activities. Eligible outreach formats explicitly include arti
 stic exhibits\, performances or festivals\, documentaries\, and the develo
 pment or use of interactive technologies\, audiovisual products or softwar
 e\, and SSHRC welcomes research-creation\, so digital culture exhibitions\
 , festivals...\n\nOrganisation: Social Sciences and Humanities Research Co
 uncil of Canada (SSHRC)\nLocation: Canada. Eligible Canadian postsecondary
  institutions\, not-for-profits\, or affiliated researchers.\nAward: Event
 s CAD 10\,000 to 25\,000\; outreach activities CAD 10\,000 to 50\,000\, ov
 er 1 year. Requires at least 50% matching cash or in-kind support. No appl
 ication fee.\nDuration: 1 year\n\nMore: https://sshrc-crsh.canada.ca/en/fu
 nding/opportunities/connection-grants/2027/competition.aspx?utm_source=art
 ificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
