 /2027/competition.aspx?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=re
 ferral
LOCATION:Canada. Eligible Canadian postsecondary institutions\, not-for-pro
 fits\, or affiliated researchers.
END:VEVENT
