SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 EST: &NOW 2027 Production Residency and Scholarship 
 (Factory Media Centre\, Hamilton)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 30 Nov 2026 at 23:59 EST.\n\nFactory Media Centre\, Hami
 lton's artist-run media arts centre\, offers its &NOW production residency
  to a media artist\, team or collective at any career stage. The resident 
 develops a media-arts project from mid-January to April 2027 with an artis
 t fee\, an equipment-rental scholarship\, staff support and a paid public 
 program\, ending in a May exhibition or open studio.\n\nOrganisation: Fact
 ory Media Centre\nLocation: Hamilton\, Ontario\, Canada. Hybrid or remote 
 work possible\; equipment rentals and 24/7 studio access are for local art
 ists.\nAward: CAD 2\,000 artist fee (split equally within a team)\, plus a
  CAD 1\,500 to 2\,000 scholarship for FMC equipment rentals and a paid pub
 lic program (amount set with staff). No application fee.\nDuration: Mid-Ja
 nuary to April 2027\, with a presentation or open studio in May 2027\n\nMo
 re: https://www.factorymediacentre.ca/andnow2027?utm_source=artificialnouv
 eaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
