 \nAward: Up to CAD 50\,000 per fiscal year or 50% of the cash budget\, whi
 chever is lower (lifetime cap CAD 100\,000 or 50%). Non-repayable. No appl
 ication fee.\nDuration: Pre-Production stream up to 18 months\; Production
  stream up to 48 months\n\nMore: https://www.creativesask.ca/our-support/d
 igital-game-development/digital-game-development/?utm_source=artificialnou
